body = f'''# Major step013 - actor gate terminal failure preserved; corrected preparation independently reviewed

Recorded {stamp}. Reviewed local/private owner ends **2026-10-02T22:36:15Z**. [Root012 independent docs PASS](INDEPENDENT_DOCS_REFRESH_REVIEW_012.json),{short('INDEPENDENT_DOCS_REFRESH_REVIEW_012.json')}, checks77 unique inputs and exact history. This root013 creation record remains historical; a different documentation audit is required.

**Actor gate008 is terminal FAILED, never replay.** [Actual failed-partition reconciliation](CONCURRENT_GATE008_FAILED_PARTITION_RECONCILIATION_001.json),{short('CONCURRENT_GATE008_FAILED_PARTITION_RECONCILIATION_001.json')}, independently rereads ten actual evidence files twice. Driver failed at2026-10-02T01:12:17.915772Z, g8-b09-other-001, exit1,32 prior acceptance metadata. JUnit has159 cases:155pass/3skip/1failure/0errors; planned partition246, difference87. The single failure is test_inbox_powershell_smoke_binds_exact_argv_environment_and_prefixes: pinned native launcher refuses base CPython runtime inventory. Before/after263 manifests are byte-identical and match driver-start4e9bcede; source_unchanged=true is the result flag, not a fresh full742 runtime/source proof. Previous32 results/XML were not independently reconciled here, and this failed partition is not accepted. No full5569 gate acceptance, terminal finished report, new release/native readiness or corrected raw003 coverage. [Directory observation](ROOT013_GATE008_METADATA_OBSERVATION_001.json) at{gate['captured_utc']} sees32 metadata receipts and driver-failed/start/plan. Root did not launch, stop, modify or replay that attempt. Exact runtime-inventory drift is under read-only diagnosis; no source/runtime restore, cleanup or weakened inventory pin is authorized.

**Raw003 isolated first execution is bound, not entered.** [Actual bound-source review](raw-component-runtime-prep003/INDEPENDENT_RAW_HARNESS_BOUND_REVIEW_003.json),{short('raw-component-runtime-prep003/INDEPENDENT_RAW_HARNESS_BOUND_REVIEW_003.json')}, conditionally accepts driver385492cf after exact two-literal reversal,37 files/23 pairs, all742 current bytes/modes/raw9, four runtime files/pytest entry and actual Pro3 held006 original/copy. [Actual twenty-key ROOT ACK](raw-component-runtime-prep003/ROOT_FIRST_EXECUTION_ACK_RAW003.json),{short('raw-component-runtime-prep003/ROOT_FIRST_EXECUTION_ACK_RAW003.json')}, expires03:45Z, isolated-only1GiB RAM/10GiB disk/600s collection3500s tests/4440s pre-intent reserve. [Three-literal PS binding](raw-component-runtime-prep003/ROOT_ACK_LAUNCH_BINDING_003_001.json),{short('raw-component-runtime-prep003/ROOT_ACK_LAUNCH_BINDING_003_001.json')}, retains template bytes when reversed; its different actual ACK-launch late review is pending at this checkpoint. ROOT must check actual fresh resources/owner/all first-use absences immediately before first entry, temporarily clear PYTEST/PYTHON/GIT_/COVERAGE controls and restore them in finally. [Environment profile](raw-component-runtime-prep003/ROOT_RAW003_ENVIRONMENT_PROFILE_001.json) records42 absent ancestor paths; installed pytest9.1.1 also recognizes pytest.toml/.pytest.toml, so separate late review and fresh ROOT launch must include all56 paths. The original42-path record stays exact. No tests/collection/source definitions ran. Counts derive only from actual first collection. The four-entry runtime guard does not establish the full base-runtime inventory which actor008 just rejected; these scopes remain separate. Entry is one-use even on pre-driver refusal; direct termination does not guarantee descendant cleanup or hard log/site/OS-sandbox closure.

**Five raw003 consumers and seven D177 test intents independently pass STATIC preparation review.** [Consumer review](raw-consumer-binding-integration-prep001/INDEPENDENT_RAW_CONSUMER_INTEGRATION_STATIC_REVIEW_001.json),{short('raw-consumer-binding-integration-prep001/INDEPENDENT_RAW_CONSUMER_INTEGRATION_STATIC_REVIEW_001.json')}, checks59 inputs, five exact raw pins, unchanged outer505909, generic source-derived guard coverage of16 globals/three helpers/base64/binascii, and395799 initial/opened/cap+1/post-proof/reread attestation bounds. API12/sevenfiles remain. Twelve inert checks are UNRUN; actual callback pre-claim/pre-mutation/pre-spawn integrity, full lifecycle and generated pins remain ahead. [Controller test review](controller-test-integration-prep001/INDEPENDENT_CONTROLLER_LINEAGE_TEST_STATIC_REVIEW_001.json),{short('controller-test-integration-prep001/INDEPENDENT_CONTROLLER_LINEAGE_TEST_STATIC_REVIEW_001.json')}, preserves the complete prior test prefix/AST and seven actor names,75 to82 named functions, not collection. Actual synthetic full742/grouped263/25+25 admission controls reject coherent parent/no-push/outside-QA/twin/runtime/module drift and restore accepted controls. Physical Git final-parent and module guards are explicit deferred/doubled boundaries. A distinct final18 source/test preparation now integrates these, W94 fixture correction, raw003 and relevant capture tests; no live overlay or final gate is selected.

**Publisher/verifier003 has conditional independent STATIC PASS; stronger test004 is frozen, peer pending.** [Producer review](publisher-schema2-revision003/INDEPENDENT_PUBLICATION_SCHEMA2_STATIC_REVIEW_003.json),{short('publisher-schema2-revision003/INDEPENDENT_PUBLICATION_SCHEMA2_STATIC_REVIEW_003.json')}, checks112 inputs/full old-middle-final742 acquisition design/typed unique597 and final parent/grouped263/36-versus34 roles/both25 deltas/20 literal policies/395799 twin bounds. Its two causal test masks remain preserved: duplicate policy assignment could hide bool rejection, whole48008 cap could hide encoded field width. [Test004](publisher-schema2-test-revision004/HANDOFF_004.md),{short('publisher-schema2-test-revision004/STAGED_MANIFEST_004.json')}, changes only those two methods, retains12 names/10 other ASTs/all producer and raw bytes and actual ceilings, and adds unique-RHS/canonical-cause plus target-token-only decoder/explicit local cap controls. UNRUN and independently reviewing. Both producers' future provenance/current paths/external record's own derived cap/current review and actual publication remain unbound. A SHA match alone does not establish semantic PASS/current owner/release/native evidence. Native front schema2/verifier33-key/groupedQA/caller guard/capture integration is under separate source-only preparation; no actual attestation/native proof.

**Front37 harness002 and inner supervisor002 independently STATIC accepted, UNRUN.** [Front review](native-attempt013-front-test-runtime002/INDEPENDENT_FRONT_GUARD_TEST_RUNTIME_STATIC_REVIEW_002.json),{short('native-attempt013-front-test-runtime002/INDEPENDENT_FRONT_GUARD_TEST_RUNTIME_STATIC_REVIEW_002.json')}, verifies exact ordered seven fixture reads, finite canonical/short reviewer mapping and all37 old test names. [Count correction](native-attempt013-front-test-runtime002/INDEPENDENT_FRONT_GUARD_TEST_RUNTIME_REVIEW_COUNT_CORRECTION_002.json) preserves the peer report while correcting its MD copy-count prose21 to actual25 (23 reference/preservation plus2 private); unchanged verdict. [Supervisor002 review](isolated-guard-test-supervisor002/INDEPENDENT_SUPERVISOR_STATIC_REVIEW_002.json),{short('isolated-guard-test-supervisor002/INDEPENDENT_SUPERVISOR_STATIC_REVIEW_002.json')}, checks40+manifest/27 pairs/13 reversed hunks,19 old functions exact, one fixed cumulative5s death deadline and26 strict string callsites. Its204 planned pure checks and18 postseal cases remain UNRUN. It cannot borrow the front37 profile or replace the distinct total60 outer requirement.

**Outer001 independently REFUSED_STATIC and permanently unbindable, UNRUN.** [Review](root-guard-test-outer-envelope001/INDEPENDENT_ROOT_OUTER_STATIC_REVIEW_001.json),{short('root-guard-test-outer-envelope001/INDEPENDENT_ROOT_OUTER_STATIC_REVIEW_001.json')}, checks62 inputs/16 absent future paths. Actual fixed OS PowerShell SHA7600ffe1 has st_nlink2 but generic capture requires1; ROOT allocates before opened-length cap; Python inner terminal reads unbounded before65536/without plain capture; active<=2 and any observed Python do not prove exact lifetime pair/direct parent; ROOT nominal text lacks types (later Python closes types before Job). Atomic pre-Resume Job assignment/shared QPC/retained-handle design is credited with explicit OS/GIL/IO limits. A distinct002 must retarget accepted supervisor002, fix narrow OS role/caps/types/exact lifetime relations and undergo different review; pin substitutions can never unlock001. Apply018prep002 alias refusal remains exact/unrun; no apply baseline/sole ACK is selected.

Resource snapshot{resource['captured_utc']}: RAM{resource['free_ram_bytes']}B/D{resource['d_free_bytes']}B passes isolated raw1GiB at that instant, fails Pro3 small5GiB/heavy10GiB; no durable lease/quiet follows. Actual Pro3 ACK006 remains HELD and supports separate isolated coordination only. [Coordination008](COORDINATION_WORKFLOW_HOLD_AND_ISOLATED_RAW_008.md) is not sole-executor ACK; live apply/canonical QA/newgate/commit/native remain held pending explicit older-executor coordination. Preserve HEAD597 actor D177 bytes/seven tests/docs83/84, consumed attempts and refusals. Actor008 terminal does not authorize takeover.

Attempt012 spent recovery command, incident/terminal twins, existing epoch and frozen science remain exact: E2A150local/149synced/111untouched/299events, Gate1FAIL/H2H3untested. Keeper52988 launcher consumed, monitor restoration due at closeout. Original reserves/disk/quiet/pipedGO/noNonInteractive/no-replay/no-public/no-push/no-outcomes/no-extra-epoch remain. Next: late raw binding review/fresh first isolated run and independent actual result audit; exact runtime inventory diagnosis; full18/native/caller/test/pin correction and audits; explicit executor ACK; fresh complete-source focused/collection/distinct fullgate; preserved83/84 docs/governance/final263/local release; actual independently reviewed postcommit/native only under original guards. No operational acceptance is implied by static preparation.
'''
primary = [ROOT/'AGENTS.md',ROOT/'HANDOFF.md',ROOT/'START_HERE.md',ROOT/'resume-2026-09-28-001/SESSION.md',BASE/'RESOURCE_COORDINATION.md']
before = {p:p.read_bytes() for p in primary}
for name,data in input_bytes.items():
    assert (BASE/name).read_bytes()==data
    once(INPUTS/name,data)
for p,data in before.items():once(BEFORE/p.relative_to(ROOT),data)
checkpoint = BASE/'30H_RESUME_CHECKPOINT_013.md'
once(checkpoint,body.encode('utf-8'))
header = (f'**MAJOR STEP013 - ACTOR GATE008 TERMINAL FAILED; ISOLATED RAW003 BOUND/UNENTERED; CONSUMER/TEST/PUBLISHER STATIC REVIEWS; OUTER001 REFUSED.**\nRecorded {stamp}. Owner ends2026-10-02T22:36:15Z. Read [checkpoint013](resume-2026-10-01-30h-001/30H_RESUME_CHECKPOINT_013.md), HANDOFF, START_HERE and latest SESSION.\nActor008 failed01:12:17Z after32 metadata acceptances: partition155pass/3skip/1failure/0errors, native startup base-runtime inventory differs; actual terminal/result/XML preserved062b8042. No final gate PASS/replay/takeover. Raw003 bounddriver385492cf/rootACK8637df33/expires03:45Z/PSeb24e71d remains UNENTERED pending different late review and fresh resource/all56config guard. Fiveconsumer STATIC2834c649; seven D177 test prep695792df; publisher003 conditionalda259fdc, stronger two-test004 frozen pending peer. Front37 harness002 STATIC7ec66f7a/copy-count correction; supervisor002 STATICb74f22da but204/18 testsUNRUN/distinct60s outer required. Outer001 REFUSEDe39cdc8d permanenthold: actual OSPSnlink2, read caps/types/lifetime pair; distinct002 underway. Apply002 refused aliases/unrun. ROOT012 docs PASSbc1669f8.\n01:14RAM2033586176/D301117779968 is only isolated-floor snapshot; Pro3 HELD/quiet unagreed/sole-executor ACK pending. Root liveapply/fullQA/newgate/commit/native held. Preserve actorHEAD597/D177/seven names/docs83/84, historical twins/epoch/science, consumed attempts/original reserves/pipedGO/noNonInteractive/no-public/no-replay. Keeper consumed/monitor restoration due. Earlier bytes below remain exact history.\n\n').encode('utf-8')
handoff = body.replace('# Major step013 - actor gate terminal failure preserved; corrected preparation independently reviewed','# Current pro2 handoff - major step013')
handoff = re.sub(r'\]\(([^)]+)\)',lambda m:']('+m.group(1)+')' if m.group(1).startswith(('http','D:','../')) else '](resume-2026-10-01-30h-001/'+m.group(1)+')',handoff)
start = ('# Start here\n\nRead [HANDOFF](HANDOFF.md), [checkpoint013](resume-2026-10-01-30h-001/30H_RESUME_CHECKPOINT_013.md) and latest [SESSION](resume-2026-09-28-001/SESSION.md).\n\nActor008 is terminal FAILED on base CPython runtime inventory after32 metadata acceptances; no replay or full gate acceptance. Raw003 isolated ACK/launcher bound but unentered at checkpoint; different late review and fresh resources/56 ancestor config checks precede first run once. Source/consumer/test/producer/front/supervisor static passes remain preparation-only. Outer001 permanently held/refused; distinct correction needed. Live apply/QA/newgate/commit/native still held for explicit executor coordination.\n\nPreserve HEAD597/D177/seven test names/docs83/84, spent attempts/twins/existing epoch/frozen science/original guards/pipedGO/noNonInteractive/no-public/no-replay/no-outcomes. Owner ends2026-10-02T22:36:15Z. Pro3 HELD/quiet unagreed; keeper consumed/monitor restoration due.\n').encode('utf-8')
for p,data in {primary[0]:header+before[primary[0]],primary[1]:handoff.encode('utf-8'),primary[2]:start}.items():
    assert p.read_bytes()==before[p]
    p.write_bytes(data)
entry = (f'\n\n## {stamp} - ROOT MAJOR013: actor008 terminal failure and independent preparations\n\nSee [checkpoint013](../resume-2026-10-01-30h-001/30H_RESUME_CHECKPOINT_013.md). Actual failed partition062b8042:155pass/3skip/1failure/0errors, planned246/difference87, driverfailed01:12:17after32 metadata. Base CPython runtime inventory differs; no replay/fullgate/currentcorrectedsourceacceptance or takeover. Raw003 actualACK8637/PSeb24 expires03:45Z but UNENTERED pending differentlate/fresh resources/all56config paths; source/countsUNRUN. Fiveconsumer2834/Cseven6957/publisherda25/front7ec6/supb74f independently STATIC qualified; pubtwo-test004 peerpending. Outer001 REFUSEDe39c permanenthold, distinct002underway;204/18/37inerttestsUNRUN. ROOT012docsPASSbc1669. RAM01:14~1.89GiB passes isolated1GiB snapshot/fails Pro3floors, nolease/quiet/soleACK. Allactorhistory/science/twins/epoch/attempt/original guards exact, monitorrestoration due. Root013 docsawaitdifferentreview; creationstatusimmutable.\n').encode('utf-8')
resource_entry = (f'\n\n### {stamp} - major013 terminal gate and separate isolated scope\n\nActor008 driver terminal FAILED01:12:17, rootactualfailed-partition/XML155pass3skip1fail; earlier32 acceptance metadata not reconciled. Native startup rejects base-runtime inventory. No replay/quiet/sole-executor takeover. [Pre-bind resource](raw-component-runtime-prep003/ROOT_RAW003_PRE_BIND_RESOURCE_001.json) at01:14 RAM2033586176/D301117779968 passes isolated1GiB snapshot, below Pro3floors. Actual Pro3held006 remains only separateisolatedcoordination; rawACK/PSboundunentered/latefreshchecksrequired. See [checkpoint013](30H_RESUME_CHECKPOINT_013.md). Keeper consumed; monitorrestorecloseoutrequired.\n').encode('utf-8')
for p,add in ((primary[3],entry),(primary[4],resource_entry)):
    assert p.read_bytes()==before[p]
    with p.open('ab') as stream:stream.write(add)
baseline=[]
for p,data in before.items():
    proof='exact_before_copy'
    if p.name=='AGENTS.md':assert p.read_bytes().endswith(data);proof='exact_retained_suffix'
    if p.name in ('SESSION.md','RESOURCE_COORDINATION.md'):assert p.read_bytes().startswith(data);proof='exact_retained_prefix'
    baseline.append({'primary':str(p.relative_to(ROOT)).replace('\\','/'),'before':row(BEFORE/p.relative_to(ROOT)),'proof':proof})
once(BASE/'DOCS_REFRESH_BASELINE_013.json',encode({'schema_version':1,'created_utc':stamp,'files':baseline}))
inputs=[{'original':row(BASE/name),'copy':row(INPUTS/name)} for name in names]
once(BASE/'DOCS_REFRESH_INPUTS_013.json',encode({'schema_version':1,'created_utc':stamp,'inputs':inputs}))
declared=[*primary,checkpoint,BASE/'DOCS_REFRESH_BASELINE_013.json',BASE/'DOCS_REFRESH_INPUTS_013.json',*[BEFORE/p.relative_to(ROOT) for p in primary],*[INPUTS/name for name in names]]
links=[]
for p,text in ((primary[0],header.decode()),(primary[1],handoff),(primary[2],start.decode()),(checkpoint,body),(primary[3],entry.decode()),(primary[4],resource_entry.decode())):
    for target in re.findall(r'\]\(([^)]+)\)',text):
        if target.startswith(('http:','https:')):continue
        path=Path(target) if re.match(r'^[A-Za-z]:',target) else p.parent/target
        assert path.exists(),target
        links.append({'document':str(p.relative_to(ROOT)).replace('\\','/'),'target':target,'resolved_path':str(path.resolve())})
audit={'schema_version':1,'checkpoint':13,'created_utc':stamp,'status':'AWAITING_INDEPENDENT_DOCUMENTATION_REVIEW','files':[row(p) for p in declared],'actual_input_count':len(inputs),'maintained_links':links,'facts':{'owner_end_utc':'2026-10-02T22:36:15Z','root012_independent_docs_review':'PASS','actor008':'TERMINAL_FAILED','prior32_actual_results_reconciled':False,'failed_partition_junit':recon['actual_junit_counts'],'raw003_first_execution':'BOUND_ACK_LAUNCHER_UNENTERED_LATE_REVIEW_PENDING','consumer_Ctest_pub_front_supervisor':'STATIC_PREPARATION_ONLY','outer001':'REFUSED_STATIC_PERMANENT_UNBINDABLE','pubtest004':'FROZEN_UNRUN_PEER_PENDING','root_live_executor_ack_received':False,'native_whole_window_quiet_agreed':False,'pro3_small_and_heavy':'HELD','live_source_or_operational_evidence_edited':False}}
once(BASE/'DOCS_REFRESH_AUDIT_013.json',encode(audit))
print(json.dumps({'checkpoint_sha256':sha(checkpoint.read_bytes()),'audit_sha256':sha(encode(audit)),'declared_files':len(declared),'inputs':len(inputs),'maintained_links':len(links)}))
